<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Balochistan carried out intelligence-based operations that neutralised twelve militants, while separate encounters in Punjab left three people dead. A gas cylinder explosion in Dera Ismail Khan killed two cousins, and a building collapse in Karachi caused four deaths and left seventeen missing. A shipwreck off Libya claimed the lives of residents from Pakistan's Bajaur district. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNTEtyX3VHdW9ndUk5VDFCYUIzUk8xMkF2eWozLWdTTnUwUkNPWnNUVElPMXRrWlJ0bFh6bktjNXpKRFIzcmxiMUF2bVJKbjZJbVFkOG05MFRIaHE1UmoxcTZobjFFR2JUT08zVTJ3ZDd0U2ZreEJSUEY1dTFLQlQtT0RzRHFORW4xbVhoWF9jb2dSV3duWXBsY2U0cEptQVBqRHRuLTRUdW11QkUwQ2xVa0pOb3JNS0hQNUpndFhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE12ckFfYU9vNnV3Q0RuNjdXcUoxR1V3MkFpcU5YYzNVdGRTZXRDRERfMEMxWEZHSWg5M1ZYbk9OZlhHbkJFNnN0d05WV09ub0hWdG1Ta2l3S3daS1ptTHFQRFE1RDhvcE5fVzRDcXlCMzlzcm50VWR4SmlpX2tNRnM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE8waDYxY2RoMUZqN1RvT19XN0tqTDN0ZzVKRHRERDFsZm1PTkY5Z1Z5Q3Zvb2ZfVG5CNFZLRWo3MDE2a09vZVFDdA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQUHZCWTVodWY4UDlnWVpoZ0dRNGRPcklLS29QRWZpdW5DRXJmS3ZTVnZ1U2dwbXJpWFlvZ1A3UlpjUGVxa0FPalZzVUhxXzBNNjhxUmVUS1JLdTA2LW9INDlYRVV5NXlhblNyVXdYUjN1TDlVaWV0bmpobkdWd1BNSVhGeUxXbDk3XzNyUkQ0U1JVMDVvU0xUMW93?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Border Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOVXRYSTlEOEEydlZvUnh3NlU3RWRtZ25nbExYRXJqajlsdkM1RVZUSkZBaTVNZjVEczJmVkl1bmZsR0pDTkZoeWI2aXZ3eTFFYVp2VGxzVHZTY2Vrcnd